OL,3,GNEWSANHS maternity staff say gas
OL,4,Aexposure left them 'panicked'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 120 NHS midwives and
OL,7,Fmaternity workers will share #735,000
OL,8,Fin compensation after being exposed to
OL,9,Fdangerously high levels of a medical
OL,10,Fgas given to women as pain relief in
OL,11,Flabour.
OL,13,FStaff at Basildon University Hospital
OL,14,Fin Essex were found to have breathed in
OL,15,Fnitrous oxide, also known as Entonox or
OL,16,Fgas and air, during long shifts for
OL,17,Fmonths and years.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
