OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANHS maternity staff say gas
OL,4,Aexposure left them 'panicked'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Midwives (RCM)
OL,7,Fsays it is the largest group legal
OL,8,Faction brought by midwives in the UK
OL,9,Fafter members were exposed between 2021
OL,10,Fand 2023 due to poor ventilation on the
OL,11,Fmaternity unit.
OL,13,FThe Mid and South Essex NHS Foundation
OL,14,FTrust, which runs the hospital, says it
OL,15,Fhas apologised to staff and "should
OL,16,Fhave acted faster".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
